SUMMARY:Risteárd Cooper: Out Of His Head
LOCATION:Pálás Screen 1\, Merchants Road\, Galway\, Galway
DESCRIPTION:It is remarkable that Out Of His Head is Risteárd Cooper’s f
 irst solo stand-up show - especially as he has been a fixture of Irish come
 dy since co-creating Après Match in the late 1990s. #GCF26 audiences know 
 they will be in for a treat\, though\, as Out Of His Head will showcase Ris
 teárd’s trademark razor-sharp impressions\, sketches\, and absurd imagin
 ings as he examines the current state of the world. Asking such big questio
 ns as: What is happening? Why is it happening? Where did it all go wrong? A
 nd who cares? Expect a dizzying mix of skits and various personalities from
  TV\, the media\, arts\, entertainment\, and sport.\nMore info: https://com
 edyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/risteard-cooper-out-of-his-head/
